"从顶分型走到底分型，中间隔着足够多的K线，才算一笔向下笔。笔是缠论里最小的一段走势，买卖点都落在笔的端点上。" = "From a top fractal to a bottom fractal with enough candles in between — that makes a down stroke. A stroke is the smallest unit of trend in Chan theory; buy/sell points sit at stroke ends.";
