/* Signal mode */
"一类是背驰：末笔创新低（一卖为新高），但价差力度弱于前段，且量能或时长也更弱；盘整里的背驰也算。强度按价差比分档：小于 0.6 为强，0.6 至小于 0.8 为中，其余为弱。" = "Type-1 is a divergence: the last stroke makes a new low (new high for a 1st sell) with weaker price force than the prior leg, and weaker volume or duration; a divergence inside a range also counts. Strength by price-range ratio: below 0.6 strong, 0.6 to below 0.8 medium, otherwise weak.";
"二类是出现一买之后，回落低点落在此前多次转折形成的价格密集区，获得支撑、没有再创新低（二卖：一卖之后反弹高点受压、没有再创新高）；之前没有一类的不算。" = "Type-2: after a 1st buy, the pullback low lands in a price cluster formed by earlier turning points and holds without a new low (2nd sell: after a 1st sell, the rebound high is capped without a new high); without a prior type-1 it does not count.";
"三类是前五笔构成中枢后，回落低点仍在中枢上沿之上、没有回到中枢，且均线逐级抬升（三卖反之）。" = "Type-3: after five strokes form a pivot, the pullback low stays above the pivot top without returning to it, with the moving average stepping higher (the reverse for a 3rd sell).";
"类型确定性：一类 0.4（背驰，待验证）、二类 0.7（回落在价格密集区获得支撑）、三类 1.0（离开中枢后不回中枢，最强确认）。" = "Type certainty: type-1 0.4 (divergence, to be verified), type-2 0.7 (pullback holds in a price cluster), type-3 1.0 (left the pivot without returning, strongest confirmation).";
"所在的最后一笔还在走，端点可能延伸甚至回到中枢，按缠论尚不成立；这一笔走完才算买卖点。" = "The last stroke is still unfolding — its end may extend or even return to the pivot, so by Chan theory it is not yet a signal; it counts once this stroke completes.";
"%@（待确认）" = "%@ (pending)";
"待确认 · 不算买卖点" = "Pending · not yet a signal";
