"最后一笔还在走时出现的买卖点也会上榜（气泡不带「✓」），之后可能被新K线改写；一周前的历史日期不再显示这类信号。" = "Signals on the still-unfolding last stroke are also listed (bubbles without \"✓\") and may be revised by new candles; historical dates more than a week back no longer show them.";
"气泡日期是信号出现那天；详情页图上的标记画在所属笔的极值 K 线，通常在出现日左侧几根，展开该买卖点可看到两个日期。" = "A bubble's date is the day the signal appeared; on the details chart the marker sits on the stroke's extreme candle, usually a few candles to the left. Expand the signal to see both dates.";
"%@ 出现；所在笔的极值在 %@，图上标记画在那根 K 线。" = "Appeared on %@; the stroke's extreme was on %@, where the chart marker sits.";
